---
---

<section class="py-24 bg-surface px-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Lo que dice nuestra comunidad</h2>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium">Miles de personas ya comparten sus viajes con Trayko por toda Colombia.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-primary">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Viajé de Bogotá a Villa de Leyva por la mitad de lo que me costaba en bus. Además conocí gente súper bacana en el camino."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-gradient flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">VR</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-bold">Valentina R.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-outline">Pasajera Frecuente</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-primary">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Como conductor, Trayko me ayuda a cubrir los gastos de gasolina en mis viajes al Eje Cafetero. La app es muy fácil de usar."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-gradient flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">SM</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-bold">Sebastián M.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-outline">Conductor Verificado</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-primary">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Me sentí muy segura viajando con Trayko. Los perfiles verificados y las calificaciones me dieron confianza desde el primer viaje."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-gradient flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">CL</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-bold">Camila L.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-outline">Viajera Verificada</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
